flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Run setup command]
    B --> C{Initial balance provided?}
    C -->|Yes| D[Store initial balance]
    C -->|No| E[Set initial balance = 0]
    D --> F[Show storage mode as local in settings]
    E --> F
    F --> G[Persist data on-device]
    G --> M[Add income or expense transaction]
    M --> N[Validate type, amount, category, date]
    N --> O{Valid input?}
    O -->|No| P[Show validation error in English]
    O -->|Yes| Q[Save transaction]
    P --> M
    Q --> R[Update budget usage per category]
    R --> S[Check remaining budget and over-limit warning]
    S --> T[Render list and filters]
    T --> U[Render daily/monthly summary]
    U --> V([End])
